# transient icon source SVGs: downloaded per family, transformed by the icon
# generator, and not persisted after the generated art is committed. The family
# folders stay tracked (via their README) so teammates can find where to add icons;
# only the raw .svg assets are ignored. See
# 2nd-gen/packages/swc/icon-source/README.md
2nd-gen/packages/swc/icon-source/ui/*.svg
2nd-gen/packages/swc/icon-source/workflow/*.svg
